<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>أحمد عيد سيد القاضي | محاسب وخبير المنظومات الضريبية والفحص الضريبي وأنظمة ERP</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts & FontAwesome -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@300;400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0f172a;
            --secondary: #1e293b;
            --accent: #2563eb;
            --accent-glow: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            --accent-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --gold: #f59e0b;
            --emerald: #10b981;
            --sap-blue: #0284c7;
            --purple: #8b5cf6;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --bg-card: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            --bg-body: #0f172a;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-body);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Print styling for CV download */
        @media print {
            header, .hero-cta, .floating-actions, footer { display: none !important; }
            body { background: #fff !important; color: #000 !important; }
            .card, .skill-item { background: #f8fafc !important; border: 1px solid #ccc !important; color: #000 !important; }
            .hero-title, .section-title { color: #000 !important; -webkit-text-fill-color: initial !important; }
            .text-muted { color: #444 !important; }
        }

        /* Navbar */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1.1rem 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 9rem 2rem 5rem;
            position: relative;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 950px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.3rem;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #cbd5e1 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
            max-width: 860px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .hero-cta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Highlight Metrics Section - 6 Symmetrical Cards */
        .metrics-section {
            max-width: 1180px;
            margin: -3rem auto 4rem;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            padding: 1.8rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        }

        .metric-card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0.8rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .metric-card:hover {
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .metric-number {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--accent);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .metric-label {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Section Layout */
        section {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 60%;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--emerald));
            margin: 10px auto 0;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        /* Cards Grid - 4 Columns for 4 Professional Pillars */
        .grid-pillars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 2rem 1.6rem;
            border-radius: 18px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        }

        .card-icon {
            width: 54px;
            height: 54px;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);
            color: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
        }

        /* Experience Timeline */
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            padding-right: 2rem;
            border-right: 2px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: -2rem;
            top: 6px;
            transform: translateX(50%);
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            border: 4px solid var(--bg-body);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .timeline-item.active::before {
            background: var(--emerald);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);
        }

        .timeline-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: var(--emerald);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        .timeline-date {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .timeline-title {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .timeline-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .timeline-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .timeline-list li {
            position: relative;
            padding-right: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .timeline-list li::before {
            content: '✓';
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            color: var(--emerald);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Skills */
        .skills-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .skill-item {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 1.6rem;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .skill-item:hover {
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .skill-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .skill-icon {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .skill-name {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 100%;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 9px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .progress {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #38bdf8);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .progress-excel { width: 90%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10b981, #34d399); }
        .progress-sap { width: 95%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); }
        .progress-erp { width: 85%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #60a5fa); }
        .progress-tax { width: 92%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f59e0b, #fbbf24); }
        .progress-audit { width: 94%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8b5cf6, #c084fc); }

        /* Contact Section */
        .contact-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95) 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 3.5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .contact-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.8rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .contact-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: #60a5fa;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Floating Action Buttons */
        .floating-actions {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 25px;
            left: 25px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .float-btn {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .float-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            background: var(--accent-hover);
        }

        .float-whatsapp {
            background: #25d366;
        }

        .float-whatsapp:hover {
            background: #1da851;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2.2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .grid-pillars { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-title { font-size: 2.4rem; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .contact-info { flex-direction: column; }
            .floating-actions { bottom: 15px; left: 15px; }
            .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .grid-pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="#" class="logo">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i>
                أحمد <span>القاضي</span>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#about">الركائز المهنية</a></li>
                <li><a href="#experience">الخبرات المهنية</a></li>
                <li><a href="#education">المؤهل الدراسي</a></li>
                <li><a href="#skills">المهارات والأنظمة</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">التواصل</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-badge">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="color: var(--purple);"></i>
                محاسب متخصص | خبير المنظومة الضريبية (SAP & القديمة) والفحص الضريبي وأنظمة ERP
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">أحمد عيد سيد القاضي</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                محاسب ضرائب واستشارات متمكن، <strong>خبير في الفحص الضريبي وتمثيل العملاء أمام مأموريات الضرائب، والمنظومة الضريبية المصرية الجديدة على نظام SAP والمنظومة القديمة</strong>، صاحب خبرة متقدمة في تقديم إقرارات الدخل والقيمة المضافة، إدارة مستندات الفاتورة الإلكترونية (Invoicing Portal)، والعمل على أنظمة ERP وإكسل المحاسبي المتقدم.
